                "description": "Server-Sent Events stream. Broadcasts facility status changes, BB runs, LP reclassifications, and upload events in real time. Keep the connection open; events arrive as 'data: ...' lines. Note: Postman supports SSE via the 'Send' button; Talend does not."
              },
              "response": []
